sequenceDiagram
    actor Operator
    participant Agent as AI Agent (LLM)
    participant Tools as Tools<br/>(nmap, drills, CLI)
    participant Target as Target Network

    Operator->>Agent: Task + scope + output schema
    activate Agent

    loop until task is complete
        Agent->>Agent: 1. Plan next step (reasoning)
        Agent->>Tools: 2. Call a tool
        activate Tools
        Tools->>Target: run action
        Target-->>Tools: raw result
        Tools-->>Agent: 3. Observe result
        deactivate Tools
    end

    Agent-->>Operator: Structured report<br/>(findings, severity, next steps)
    deactivate Agent
